      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "还是因为想看见谁的笑容，或是想炒热气氛等等……\n我明白这些都是很棒的事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "584a5969da6faf0414ab9dabbd1157f391b72cf37e6d990f229b2a9e603c48d0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
