    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:266a84b80627ec3f180d5d51",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……话虽如此，训练员和赛马娘本来就不一定要有相同的梦想。\n也有很多赛马娘只是为了能出道，而和训练员签约。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b935136f23d649cdd01e8ef7c39c42b7c8bea0864dd034bab97f07803f585642",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1057/storytimeline_041057003.json",
      "json_path": [
